{"session_id": "sess_1789251391", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T22:16:31.346696", "mode": "practice", "score": 2, "total": 2, "percentage": 100.0, "time_seconds": 45, "seconds_per_question": 22.5, "section_breakdown": {"A": {"correct": 2, "total": 2}, "B": {"correct": 0, "total": 0}, "C": {"correct": 0, "total": 0}}, "category_breakdown": {"Kanji Reading / Kanji Writing": {"correct": 1, "total": 1}, "Grammar Particles": {"correct": 1, "total": 1}}, "details": [{"id": "MEXT-A-01", "question": "つぎの ぶんの ＿＿＿の ことばは どう かきますか。\n昨日は とても 【さむかった】 です。", "category": "Kanji Reading / Kanji Writing", "level": "JLPT N3/N4", "user_answer": "A", "correct_answer": "A", "is_correct": true, "explanation": "「さむい」 corrisponde al kanji 寒 (freddo climatico/atmosferico). 暑 (caldo), 痛 (doloroso), 暗 (buio/oscuro).", "section": "A"}, {"id": "MEXT-A-02", "question": "毎朝、駅まで 自転車＿＿＿ 行きます。", "category": "Grammar Particles", "level": "JLPT N3", "user_answer": "B", "correct_answer": "B", "is_correct": true, "explanation": "La particella で (de) indica il mezzo o strumento con cui si compie un'azione di movimento: 自転車で行きます (vado in bicicletta).", "section": "A"}]}
